## Run

Needs JDK {{index .V.Java "lts"}}. Maven is downloaded by the wrapper on first use.

```bash
./mvnw spring-boot:run
```

On Windows use `mvnw.cmd`. Settings come from environment variables (see `.env.example`).
{{- if .Opt.HasExtra "docker-compose"}}

Or with Docker (app{{if .HasDB}} + database{{end}}):

```bash
docker compose up --build
```
{{- end}}

Check it works:

```bash
curl http://localhost:8080/health
curl "http://localhost:8080/api/v1/hello?name=Bat"
```
{{- if .Opt.HasExtra "swagger"}}

API docs: http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html (spec at `/v3/api-docs`).
{{- end}}

